    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περον-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pierce, transfix</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουρὶ μέσον περόνησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.145
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				13.397
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μέσον τὸν βραχίονα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔδειξε . . τὰς χεῖρας ὡς ἦσαν
					πεπερονημέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cels.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Origenes
				<u>Cels.</u>
				2.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>buckle on one's</i> mantle, <i>one's</i> robe,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαῖναν περονήσατο, ἑανὸν
			περονᾶτο</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.180
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῶπος περονᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.66
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.722
			</span></i>.</div>
